    "detailed_description": "<strong>BATTLE ROOM BETA</strong> offers an immersive online multiplayer TPS shooter experience, completely free as a beta version. No daily maintenance, installation or complex configuration required: Just start the game! As simple as opening a door, incredibly easy to get into the action! <br><br>Non-stop adrenaline-filled excitement awaits you in different battle rooms where 2 teams will face each other! Players will be able to enjoy high-quality graphics even on very low-end devices!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838380/extras/d2f4d5cb9fbb6a4d10788ac788bde6d1.poster.avif?t=1742199035\" width=600 height=94 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838380/extras/d2f4d5cb9fbb6a4d10788ac788bde6d1.webm?t=1742199035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838380/extras/215edac73c90a21a51c3566c9b8d3715.poster.avif?t=1742199035\" width=600 height=94 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838380/extras/215edac73c90a21a51c3566c9b8d3715.webm?t=1742199035\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Limited edition characters with unique abilities</strong> for the beta version, but with fairly balanced gameplay.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2838380/extras/856a114f8df382a1b63c6928c9eddb8f.poster.avif?t=1742199035\" width=600 height=94 ><source src=\"http